# Platform tenant offboarding (P2-E)

Super Admin **Actions** tab danger zone: offboard → GDPR zip export → scheduled purge. Operator OTP blocked on `offboarding`. Denali workspace package is **not** modified.

## Lifecycle

| status | Meaning |
|--------|---------|
| `active` / `suspended` | P1 semantics |
| `offboarding` | Retention window before purge |

```text
POST .../offboard (owner)
  → status=offboarding · offboardingStartedAt · scheduledDeletionAt (+30d default)
  → sessionVersion++ · audit TENANT_OFFBOARDING_STARTED

POST .../cancel-offboard (owner)
  → status=active · clear dates · audit TENANT_OFFBOARDING_CANCELED

POST .../export (owner)
  → audit TENANT_EXPORT_REQUESTED · zip stream (9 JSON files)

POST .../purge (owner)
  → only if scheduledDeletionAt <= now · audit TENANT_DELETED · tenant.delete

POST .../tenants/run-scheduled-deletions (owner)
  → batch purge due tenants
```

PATCH `/status` with `{ status: "active" }` while offboarding → **403** `TENANT_OFFBOARDING_USE_CANCEL`.

## API

| Method | Path | RBAC |
|--------|------|------|
| POST | `/platform/v1/tenants/{id}/offboard` | owner |
| POST | `/platform/v1/tenants/{id}/cancel-offboard` | owner |
| POST | `/platform/v1/tenants/{id}/export` | owner · zip |
| POST | `/platform/v1/tenants/{id}/purge` | owner |
| POST | `/platform/v1/tenants/run-scheduled-deletions` | owner |
| GET | `/platform/v1/audit/export?from=&to=` | owner · CSV |

Detail DTO adds `offboardingStartedAt` · `scheduledDeletionAt`.

## GDPR zip entries

`manifest.json` · `tenant.json` · `tenant-configs.json` · `user-tenants.json` · `operator-pending-invites.json` · `tours.json` · `tenant-domains.json` · `audit-events.json` · `platform-audit-events.json`

## Environment

| Variable | Default |
|----------|---------|
| `PLATFORM_OFFBOARD_RETENTION_DAYS` | `30` |
| `PLATFORM_AUDIT_EXPORT_MAX_ROWS` | `10000` |

## UI

- Actions tab: `TabActionsDanger` (`data-danger-zone`) — offboard · cancel · export
- Audit page: `data-audit-export-download` CSV link (owner BFF)

See also: [`platform-control-center-api.mdoc`](platform-control-center-api.mdoc) · [`platform-impersonation.mdoc`](platform-impersonation.mdoc)
